{"3824840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nezori", "steam_appid": 3824840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.poster.avif?t=1787999860\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.webm?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.mp4?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nezori is a cute action RPG set in a world inhabited by fox girls and wolf girls. When the young fox girl Atsuko sets out on an adventure to find the legendary hot springs, the wolf-like Sothiens stand in her way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now she must fight the deadly wolf girls and get strong enough to reach her goal. But that doesn’t mean there’s no time to relax. Her village is peaceful, and the cute fox girls who live there have plenty of requests she can help with. She can even find the little fox girl Hana while out exploring and spend some time with her! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s a lot to do… but Atsuko is determined to see it through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.poster.avif?t=1787999860\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.webm?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.mp4?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a fully voiced cast of cute fox girls and deadly wolf girls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with Hana, a cute little fox girl who can help you while you explore. Pet her head or tail anytime! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies in fast-paced action combat using a variety of abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials in the world and craft better equipment for your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.poster.avif?t=1787999860\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.webm?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.mp4?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nezori is a cute action RPG set in a world inhabited by fox girls and wolf girls. When the young fox girl Atsuko sets out on an adventure to find the legendary hot springs, the wolf-like Sothiens stand in her way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now she must fight the deadly wolf girls and get strong enough to reach her goal. But that doesn’t mean there’s no time to relax. Her village is peaceful, and the cute fox girls who live there have plenty of requests she can help with. She can even find the little fox girl Hana while out exploring and spend some time with her! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s a lot to do… but Atsuko is determined to see it through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.poster.avif?t=1787999860\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.webm?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.mp4?t=1787999860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a fully voiced cast of cute fox girls and deadly wolf girls. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with Hana, a cute little fox girl who can help you while you explore. Pet her head or tail anytime! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies in fast-paced action combat using a variety of abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials in the world and craft better equipment for your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A cute action RPG adventure about a fox girl searching for the legendary hot springs in a world of fox and wolf girls. Help cute fox girls, fight deadly wolf girls, and occasionally come across the playful little fox girl Hana during your journey.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_